            <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-indigo-200">Home should feel like a place where you can relax, be yourself, and let your guard down. That sense of emotional safety has a powerful effect on your mental well-being.</p>
