        title: "Why Do I Hate Myself So Much — And How Do I Get Rid of This Feeling?",
        excerpt: "Self-hatred is an exhausting emotional burden that often exists quietly in the background. Learn why these feelings develop and how to begin the journey of self-compassion and healing.",
